description	"Jedi Watchman

2-life Utility Focused Stealth Jedi with customizable Force Powers and Lightsaber attributes.

^2Weaponry: 
- Melee
- Lightsaber
-- Lightsaber Staff (Staff)
-- Saber With Shoto (Duals/Cyan)
-- Single Saber (Yellow/Blue)
-- Saber Throw ^3[CS1]

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Force Focus (2)
- Force Block (1)
- Anti Mind Trick (1)
- Force Sense (3)
- Knockdown Roll
- Dexterity (1)
- Security Scanner (Tracking Beacon)
- Force Blind (3)
- Force Jump (1)
- Force Sight Immunity
- Infiltration Specialist (15% Faster Hack Speed)"